---
title: Theme Configuration Overview
---

The iOS app's visual theme lives in a single JSON file: **`VERA/Theme/semantics.json`**. This is the file you'll edit to customize colors, corner rounding, and typography without touching any Swift source code.

## Where It Lives

{% filetree %}

- VERA/
  - App/
  - Config/
    - app-config.json
  - Scripts/
  - Theme/
    - semantics.json   ← Theme tokens live here
  - VERAApp/
  - VERAConfiguration/
  - VERACommonUI/

{% /filetree %}

## How It's Structured

`semantics.json` nests every token under `themes.vonage`, split into three groups: `colors`, `borderRadius`, and `typography`:

```json
{
  "themes": {
    "vonage": {
      "colors": {
        "light": { "primary": "#9941FF", "background": "#F5F0FD", "...": "..." },
        "dark":  { "primary": "#B27BF2", "background": "#26044D", "...": "..." }
      },
      "borderRadius": {
        "none": 0, "extra-small": 2, "small": 4, "medium": 8, "large": 12, "extra-large": 24
      },
      "typography": {
        "font-family": "Inter",
        "desktop": { "headline": { "font-size": "66px", "line-height": "88px", "font-weight": 500 }, "...": "..." },
        "mobile":  { "headline": { "font-size": "32px", "line-height": "40px", "font-weight": 500 }, "...": "..." }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

- **`colors.light` / `colors.dark`** — Separate color palettes for each mode. Both modes use the same set of semantic token keys.
- **`borderRadius`** — Six named tokens controlling the corner rounding of buttons, cards, and dialogs.
- **`typography`** — A shared `font-family`, plus separate `desktop` and `mobile` type scales. Both scales use the same named tokens, just with different point sizes.

## Color Token Reference

Here's the subset of color tokens you'll work with most often:

| Token | Light default | Dark default | Role |
|-------|--------------|--------------|------|
| `primary` | `#9941FF` | `#B27BF2` | Main brand accent |
| `background` | `#F5F0FD` | `#26044D` | Page background |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | `#000000` | Cards and panels |
| `text-primary` | `#9941FF` | `#B27BF2` | Primary text |
| `error` | `#E61D1D` | `#F75959` | Errors and destructive actions |
| `warning` | `#BE5702` | `#FA9F00` | Warnings |
| `success` | `#1C8731` | `#30A849` | Confirmations |
| `border` | `#E6E6E6` | `#333333` | Dividers and borders |

## Border Radius Tokens

Border radius tokens are shared between light and dark mode — they only control shape, not color:

| Token | Default (pt) |
|-------|--------------|
| `none` | `0` |
| `extra-small` | `2` |
| `small` | `4` |
| `medium` | `8` |
| `large` | `12` |
| `extra-large` | `24` |

## Typography Tokens

`typography.font-family` sets the single font used across the app. The `desktop` and `mobile` scales each define the same named tokens with different sizes:

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `font-family` | `Inter` |

### Desktop scale (`typography.desktop`)

| Token | Font size | Line height | Font weight |
|-------|-----------|-------------|--------------|
| `headline` | `66px` | `88px` | `500` |
| `subtitle` | `40px` | `52px` | `500` |
| `heading-1` | `32px` | `40px` | `500` |
| `heading-2` | `28px` | `36px` | `500` |
| `heading-3` | `24px` | `32px` | `500` |
| `heading-4` | `20px` | `28px` | `500` |
| `body-extended` | `18px` | `24px` | `400` |
| `body-extended-semibold` | `18px` | `24px` | `600` |
| `body-base` | `16px` | `22px` | `400` |
| `body-base-semibold` | `16px` | `22px` | `600` |
| `caption` | `12px` | `16px` | `400` |
| `caption-semibold` | `12px` | `16px` | `600` |

### Mobile scale (`typography.mobile`)

| Token | Font size | Line height | Font weight |
|-------|-----------|-------------|--------------|
| `headline` | `32px` | `40px` | `500` |
| `subtitle` | `24px` | `32px` | `500` |
| `heading-1` | `22px` | `28px` | `500` |
| `heading-2` | `20px` | `26px` | `500` |
| `heading-3` | `18px` | `24px` | `500` |
| `heading-4` | `16px` | `22px` | `500` |
| `body-extended` | `16px` | `22px` | `400` |
| `body-extended-semibold` | `16px` | `22px` | `600` |
| `body-base` | `14px` | `20px` | `400` |
| `body-base-semibold` | `14px` | `20px` | `600` |
| `caption` | `12px` | `16px` | `400` |
| `caption-semibold` | `12px` | `16px` | `600` |

Next, you'll edit some of these tokens and regenerate the corresponding color asset catalog.
